  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme for the Promotion and Protection of Women and Children&#x2019;s Rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To  increase gender equality in Zambia  by providing capacity building support to the Ministry of Gender and Child Development (MGCD).This will contribute to MDG 3 by strengthening capacity to coordinate and implement gender responsive policy planning and budgeting including increased collection of sex-disaggregated data by 2016</narrative>
